   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The function <span data-math=\"T\">T</span> tells how many people are living on floor <span data-math=\"n\">n</span> of an apartment building. What does <span data-math=\"T(4)=82\">T(4)=82</span> mean?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224589,
     "content_html": "There are 4 people living on floor 82."
    },
